      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwagiza Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni, akamwambia, “Uwe imara na hodari, maana utawaongoza Waisraeli katika nchi ambayo nimewaapia kuwapa, nami nitakuwa pamoja nawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose alipomaliza kuandika maneno ya sheria hiyo tangu mwanzo mpaka mwisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aliwaambia Walawi, waliokuwa na jukumu la kubeba lile sanduku la agano la Mwenyezi-Mungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chukueni kitabu hiki cha sheria, mkiweke karibu na sanduku la agano la Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, ili kiwe ushahidi dhidi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana najua mlivyo waasi na wakaidi. Ikiwa mmemwasi Mwenyezi-Mungu wakati niko hai pamoja nanyi, itakuwaje baada ya kifo changu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakusanye mbele yangu wazee wote wa makabila yenu na maofisa wenu nipate kusema maneno haya wasikie, nazo mbingu na dunia zishuhudie juu yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana ninajua kuwa baada ya kifo changu hakika mtakuwa waovu na kuiacha ile njia niliyowaamuru mwifuate. Na katika siku zijazo mtakumbwa na maafa kwa kuwa mtafanya maovu mbele ya Bwana na kumkasirisha kwa matendo yenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
